## PinsApi

### Get multiple Pin analytics
## Get multiple Pin analytics
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/pins/analytics?pinIds={{pinIds}}&startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}&appTypes={{appTypes}}&metricTypes={{metricTypes}}&adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Accept: application/json

### Get Pin analytics
## Get Pin analytics
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/pins/{{pin_id}}/analytics?startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}&appTypes={{appTypes}}&metricTypes={{metricTypes}}&splitField={{splitField}}&adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Accept: application/json

### Create Pin
## Create Pin
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/pins?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "ai_disclosures": "<string>",
 "alt_text": "<string>",
 "board_id": "<string>",
 "board_section_id": "<string>",
 "description": "<string>",
 "dominant_color": "<string>",
 "link": "<string>",
 "media_source": "<string>",
 "parent_pin_id": "<string>",
 "sponsor_id": "<string>",
 "title": "<string>"
}


### Delete Pin
## Delete Pin
DELETE https://api.pinterest.com/v5/pins/{{pin_id}}?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Accept: application/json

### Get Pin
## Get Pin
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/pins/{{pin_id}}?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}&pinMetrics={{pinMetrics}}
Accept: application/json

### List Pins
## List Pins
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/pins?pinFilter={{pinFilter}}&pinMetrics={{pinMetrics}}&includeProtectedPins={{includeProtectedPins}}&pinType={{pinType}}&creativeTypes={{creativeTypes}}&adAccountId={{adAccountId}}&domain={{domain}}&domains={{domains}}&includeProductTagObj={{includeProductTagObj}}&bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json

### Save Pin
## Save Pin
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/pins/{{pin_id}}/save?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "board_id": "<string>",
 "board_section_id": "<string>"
}


### Update Pin
## Update Pin
PATCH https://api.pinterest.com/v5/pins/{{pin_id}}?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "ai_disclosures": "<string>",
 "alt_text": "<string>",
 "board_id": "<string>",
 "board_section_id": "<string>",
 "carousel_slots": "<string>",
 "description": "<string>",
 "link": "<string>",
 "title": "<string>"
}

